abstract: >-
  Testbed, raw measurements and analysis comparing WireGuard, OpenVPN (UDP/TCP),
  SSH port forwarding and SSH layer-3 tunnelling on throughput, CPU cost,
  latency, loss robustness and exposure to unauthenticated probing.
